    <name>Crans-Montana: Alpages Bike</name>
    <desc>21.3 km, +918/-917 m. This mountain bike route explores the region's high alpine pastures. It is a sporty way to discover the local wildlife and plant life, with superb views across the surrounding peaks. Source: Crans-Montana - Alpages Bike. Official Outdooractive geometry supplied by Crans-Montana, simplified to 8 m.</desc>
