  <trk>
    <name>Crans-Montana: 1988 World Champs Bike</name>
    <desc>19.7 km, +1053/-1051 m. Following in the tracks of the 1988 Mountain Bike World Championships, this demanding alpine route links Aminona with the Tieche waterfalls, through wild forests, authentic mayens and sweeping mountain views. Source: Crans-Montana - 1988 World Champs Bike. Official Outdooractive geometry supplied by Crans-Montana, simplified to 8 m.</desc>
