  <trk>
    <name>Crans-Montana: Coteaux Bike</name>
    <desc>19.8 km, +857/-857 m. Discover an action-packed loop between forests, alpine villages and recreational areas. It offers superb views of the Alps and the Rhone valley, before returning to the shore of Lake Moubra. Source: Crans-Montana - Coteaux Bike. Official Outdooractive geometry supplied by Crans-Montana, simplified to 8 m.</desc>
