  <trk>
    <name>Crans-Montana: Valais Alpine Bike</name>
    <desc>39.5 km, +740/-1600 m. One of the most popular mountain-biking routes in Central Valais climbs from Crans-Montana up to Alp Merdechon. It continues across the Tieche and descends over varied, partly challenging trails to Leuk/Susten. Source: Crans-Montana - Valais Alpine Bike. Official Outdooractive geometry supplied by Crans-Montana, simplified to 8 m.</desc>
