  <trk>
    <name>Anzere: Tulipe Bike</name>
    <desc>24.7 km intermediate loop, +894/-901 m. It crosses the mayens du Go and Combe d Arbaz, descends through Planege and the villages of Blignou, Botyre and Luc, then climbs back to Anzere on a forest road. Source: Anzere Tourism. Official GPX geometry supplied by Anzere Tourism, simplified to 15 m.</desc>
