  <trk>
    <name>Verbier: Enduro 05 - La Chaux - Shlerondes - Le Chable</name>
    <desc>10.6 km, +56/-1,432 m advanced enduro route. Varied advanced descent from La Chaux through Shlerondes and authentic hamlets. The trail to Sarreyer changes steepness and difficulty quickly; the lower section to Le Chable is gentler and finishes on rewarding singletrack. Slow down through the hamlets. Source: Verbier - Enduro 05. Official GPX geometry, simplified to 8 m.</desc>
