  <trk>
    <name>Verbier: Enduro 01 - Verbier - Le Chable</name>
    <desc>7.7 km, +97/-799 m beginner enduro route. Easy, quick route from Verbier to Le Chable. It starts with a steep gravel-road descent to Medieres, crosses the Verbier road several times, climbs briefly to the Vernays chapel viewpoint, then finishes on a winding forest road. Source: Verbier - Enduro 01. Official GPX geometry, simplified to 8 m.</desc>
