  <trk>
    <name>Verbier: Enduro 07 - Fontanet - La Chaux</name>
    <desc>4.6 km, +106/-320 m advanced enduro route. Technically and physically demanding alpine route from Fontanet to the Cabane Mont Fort, including a long, rocky traverse. The descent broadens below the hut before a standout singletrack follows the alpine stream back to La Chaux. Control speed near the busy hut section. Source: Verbier - Enduro 07. Official GPX geometry, simplified to 8 m.</desc>
