  <trk>
    <name>Verbier: Enduro 08 - Ruinettes - Planards - Verbier</name>
    <desc>12.1 km, +256/-930 m beginner enduro route. Verbier's most accessible enduro route and a gentle introduction to the discipline. It follows part of La Planie from Les Ruinettes, turns toward Les Planards, then returns to Verbier through Mayen de Bry and Carrefour. Source: Verbier - Enduro 08. Official GPX geometry, simplified to 8 m.</desc>
