  <trk>
    <name>Verbier: Enduro 11 - La Chaux - Lourtier</name>
    <desc>5.7 km, +107/-1,218 m expert enduro route. Very steep, technical and sustained expert descent. A demanding traverse reaches the Mintzet pasture before the trail enters an exposed no-fall forest ridge, drops roughly 1,000 m, and finishes along the torrent embankment into Lourtier. Source: Verbier - Enduro 11. Official GPX geometry, simplified to 8 m.</desc>
