  <trk>
    <name>Verbier: Enduro 12 - Gentianes - La Chaux</name>
    <desc>7.1 km, +40/-702 m beginner enduro route. Beginner high-altitude route above 2,800 m through stark, lunar scenery. A mountain road and scenic trail pass below the Bec des Rosses, with the Cabane Mont Fort offering a natural break before the second half of the descent. Source: Verbier - Enduro 12. Official GPX geometry, simplified to 8 m.</desc>
