  <trk>
    <name>Verbier: Enduro 15 - Moay - Cabane Brunet</name>
    <desc>24.2 km, +857/-1,672 m advanced enduro route. Long, rolling tour from the top of the Bruson gondola at Moay to Cabane Brunet. After a traverse to Momin, a gravel climb gains about 500 m to the hut; the long, relatively easy descent toward Champsec and Le Chable repeatedly crosses the road. Watch for hikers and control speed. Source: Verbier - Enduro 15. Official GPX geometry, simplified to 8 m.</desc>
