  <trk>
    <name>Verbier: Enduro 21 - Croix de Coeur - La Tzoumaz</name>
    <desc>6.0 km, +2/-620 m beginner enduro route. Long, playful beginner singletrack from Croix de Coeur toward La Tzoumaz. It winds through subalpine heath, pines and rhododendrons, crosses the road twice, then finishes with a particularly flowing forest section on soft humus. Source: Verbier - Enduro 21. Official GPX geometry, simplified to 8 m.</desc>
