  <trk>
    <name>Verbier: Tsenelle</name>
    <desc>1.8 km green downhill trail. Very easy flow trail from the top of La Chaux-Express to La Chaux. Its gentle, playful descent includes rest and learning areas, wooden sculptures, two bridges, and wide views over the Combins, Mont Fort and Mont Blanc. Source: Verbier - Tsenelle. Official GPX geometry, simplified to 8 m.</desc>
