  <trk>
    <name>Verbier: Bortabitche</name>
    <desc>1.7 km, +21/-235 m red downhill trail. Sustained red trail from Fontanet beneath La Chaux-Express, alternating technical passages, berms and jumps. Its signature feature is more than 300 m of wooden structures crossing a large rock field before the trail reaches the Ruinettes side of the lift. Source: Verbier - Bortabitche. Official GPX geometry, simplified to 8 m.</desc>
