    <name>Verbier: Rodze</name>
    <desc>2.1 km red downhill trail. Verbier's emblematic red trail from Fontanet toward La Chaux and Les Ruinettes, combining 65 jumps, berms and rocky sections with open views toward the Combins massif. Source: Verbier - Rodze. Official GPX geometry, simplified to 8 m.</desc>
