    <name>Verbier: Woooohhh</name>
    <desc>0.5 km black downhill trail. Short, slow and highly technical black alternative after Wouaiy near Clambin. A dense sequence of jumps and rocky passages leads to the finish at Medran. Source: Verbier - Woooohhh. Official GPX geometry, simplified to 8 m.</desc>
