  <trk>
    <name>Verbier: Enduro 23 - Vallon d'Arbi</name>
    <desc>11.4 km red enduro route through the Vallon d'Arbi, descending from the high alpine terrain above Lac des Vaux toward La Tzoumaz. It begins with about 250 m of elevation gain on a very steep gravel road. After the climb, the route becomes a technical natural trail through beautiful alpine scenery. Source: Verbier - Enduro 23 Expert Vallon d'Arbi.</desc>
