  <wpt lat="46.225500" lon="6.788600">
    <name>Châtel / Pré-la-Joux (Portes du Soleil, FR) [33 EUR]</name>
    <desc>Châtel bike park - Pré-la-Joux sector

    Trails
The densest concentration of built trails in the whole Portes du Soleil, and the main reason to make the crossing: Bike Patrol, Serpentine, Fluid, Coup d'Fouet, Ric et Rac, People, Gueps, Air Voltage, Komatrautrail, the three-part Vink Line, Dre dans l'Pentu, plus Haute Tension, Paroramic, Black Shore and Vorachatak on the Linga side. Everything from green flow to World Cup black, all off the same two lifts.

    Getting up / price
Chatel bike day pass 33 EUR adult / 30 EUR youth-senior / 25 EUR child. Full Portes du Soleil day pass 39 EUR adult.

    Open season
Open from 12 June; closed from 14 September (typical window; check the operator and conditions).
Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00
Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.

    Access
From | Transport | Duration
Lausanne | Boat + bus | ~2h20

    Source: Chatel Bike Park.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</desc>
  </wpt>
