  <wpt lat="46.441362" lon="8.166794">
    <name>Bellwald (Goms, above Fiesch) [from 40 CHF]</name>
    <desc>Richinen 2000 m - top of the Bellwald gondola

    Trails
One of Switzerland's premier bike parks: Forest Bump (flowtrail), Slider Man (jump line), Vast &amp; Furious (high alpine line), and Dirty Cranking (downhill track used for iXS Downhill Cup). Rich variety of drops, gap jumps, technical root lines, and flow turns. South facing, so it dries fast and rides well into October. Bellwald and the wider Aletsch Arena return as a UCI Enduro World Cup venue in 2026 after hosting the 2025 World Championships enduro races.

    Getting up / price
Chairlift access (Sesselbahn Bellwald-Richinen). Bike day pass costs approximately 40-48 CHF.

    Open season
Open from late May/early June; closed from late October (typical window; check the operator and conditions).
Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00
Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.

    Access
From | Transport | Duration
Lausanne | Train + bus | ~2h45

    Sources: Bellwald and 2026 UCI calendar.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</desc>
  </wpt>
