  <wpt lat="46.138300" lon="7.964000">
    <name>Saas-Fee - Kreuzboden/Hohsaas [48 CHF]</name>
    <desc>Kreuzboden 2400 m - top of the Saas-Grund gondola

    Trails
The Kreuzboden-Hohsaas bike area above Saas-Grund is the Saas Valley hub with ~80 km of trails. The Hohsaas Trail starts at 3125 m and drops over 1600 vertical metres past glacial lakes; the Trift Flowtrail runs from Kreuzboden to Saas-Grund. A Bike Skills Park with three short training lines and a conveyor belt sits right at Kreuzboden, and the new Hannig Bike Trail in Saas-Fee adds a separate red/blue loop. The Upper Valais Bike Pass links this spot with Grächen, Belalp, Aletsch Arena and Bellwald on a single ticket.

    Getting up / price
Biker day ticket 48 CHF (adults without SaastalCard); 15 CHF with SaastalCard (free for hotel guests). Bike transport is free with the Magic Pass. The Upper Valais 3-day Bike Pass is 127 CHF. Check saas-fee.ch before travelling.

    Open season
Open from 15 June; closed from 19 October (typical window; check the operator and conditions).
Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00
Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.

    Access
From | Transport | Duration
Lausanne | Train + bus | ~2h30

    Source: Saas-Fee.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</desc>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="46.139740" lon="7.991040">
    <name>Saas-Fee: Hohsaas 3125 m - upper station</name>
    <desc>Top of the Hohsaas gondola; start of the high-alpine Hohsaas Trail with 1600 m vertical to Saas-Grund.</desc>
  </wpt>
