  <trk>
    <name>Le Suchet: Jougne - Suchet loop</name>
    <desc>20.2 km difficult cross-border loop from Jougne to the 1588 m Suchet summit, with about 956 m of climbing and descent through forest and high pastures. The route is shared with hikers and is officially listed for MTB use; expect technical summit terrain and yield to walkers. Source: Explore Doubs Rando. Official GPX geometry, simplified to 8 m.</desc>
