  <trk>
    <name>Le Chasseron: Tour des Alpages</name>
    <desc>22 km official MTB loop from Les Rasses through the wooded pastures and alpine chalets around the Chasseron massif. A more approachable alternative to Chasseron Bike, focused on scenic forest tracks and Jura pasture riding. Source: Commune of Bullet. Official GPX geometry supplied by the Commune of Bullet, simplified to 8 m.</desc>
