  <wpt lat="46.851795" lon="6.538253">
    <name>Le Chasseron (Sainte-Croix) [no lift]</name>
    <desc>Le Chasseron 1607 m - summit

    Trails
Long grassy ridge descents with one of the best panoramas in the Jura - the whole Alpine chain on a clear day. Fast and flowing up high, forest tracks lower down towards Sainte-Croix or Bullet. Pairs well with Le Suchet if you want a big day.

    Getting up / price
No lift. Lausanne &gt; Yverdon 25 min &gt; Sainte-Croix 35 min, then about 600 m of climbing from Les Rasses.

    Open season
Open from 15 April; closed from 16 November (typical window; check the operator and conditions).

    Access
From | Transport | Duration
Lausanne | Train | ~1h10

    Source: Yverdon region.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</desc>
  </wpt>
