    <name>La Colmiane: Pic chairlift base (Col Saint-Martin, 1470 m)</name>
  </wpt>
  <trk>
    <name>Mont Gros: summit to Roquebrune via Col de la Coupiere</name>
    <desc>4.4 km natural descent from Mont Gros to the road above Roquebrune-Cap-Martin. Before the Col de la Coupiere it follows the singletrack past the small pond and picnic table. From the col it takes the right-hand trail through La Coupiere and the unnamed 452 m summit. The lower section is T4 / E2 with numerous obstacles and is normally ridden downhill only. Sources: VTTour sentier 223; summit-to-col geometry simplified from OpenStreetMap ways 93220573 and 93220584 (ODbL).</desc>
