    <desc>Summer mountain-bike trails at Mzaar Kfardebian

    Trails
Lebanon's largest mountain resort advertises summer MTB trails designed for speed, mountain exploration and full-day riding. Expect open limestone terrain, high ridges and natural resort tracks rather than a fully documented modern downhill park.

    Getting up / price
Book the resort's MTB activity or arrange local support. Summer bicycle carriage on the ski lifts could not be verified, so plan on pedal or vehicle-assisted access rather than assuming uplift.

    Open season
Open from 01 May; closed from 01 December (typical snow-free window).
Daily opening hours: 08:00-17:00
