    Trails
Bosnia's clearest operating bike park uses purpose-built downhill and enduro terrain on the Olympic mountain. Expect open ski-slope sections, rocky technical ground and wooded lower trails rather than a large network of machine-built flow.

    Getting up / price
The K1 surface lift uses a special bicycle hook to tow riders and bikes uphill. Check the Olympic Centre for the current bike ticket and operating days.

    Open season
Open from 01 June; closed from 01 October (typical summer operating window).
