A resort-operated bike trail on the 1984 Olympic mountain, combining open alpine riding with forest and shaped gravity sections. The developing park is suitable for confident riders but has less documented progression terrain than the large Alpine resorts.

    Getting up / price
Summer resort uplift serves the bike trail when scheduled. Check Jahorina for the current lift, bike transport and ticket details.

    Open season
