    <desc>Millennium Cross 1066 m - natural singletrack above Skopje

    Trails
A dense local network drops through forest from the Vodno summit toward Skopje and west toward Matka Canyon. Lines range from fast flow to steep, rocky expert singletrack; this is natural shared mountain riding, not a managed bike park.

    Getting up / price
The gondola from Middle Vodno normally has bicycle hooks, with a pedal or bus climb to its base. Major maintenance reportedly closes it through much of summer 2026, so verify reopening before relying on uplift.

    Open season
Open from 15 September; closed from 01 December (conservative 2026 post-maintenance window).
Daily opening hours: 10:00-18:00
