    <desc>Marked mountain-bike routes around Mavrovo Lake and Bistra

    Trails
North Macedonia's largest national park contains marked and unmarked mountain-bike routes through Bistra, Korab foothills, forest and high pasture. Historical freeride/flow development exists near the resort, but current lift-assisted bike operation could not be verified.

    Getting up / price
Plan on pedal access or a booked local shuttle. National-park rules apply, and high fire danger can trigger mandatory registration or complete forest-access restrictions.

    Open season
