Kosovo's best-documented mountain-bike destination links Peja, Rugova Canyon and the Accursed Mountains. Mapped routes deliver more than 1700 m of vertical across rocky mule paths, forest singletrack, high pasture and cross-border adventure terrain.

    Getting up / price
No verified mechanical uplift. Pedal from Peja or arrange local guide and vehicle support. Border-crossing and protected-area routes may require permissions, so confirm the exact itinerary.

