  <wpt lat="45.893970" lon="6.406810">
    <name>La Clusaz (Aravis, FR) [23.50 EUR]</name>
    <desc>Beauregard 1630 m - top of the Beauregard gondola

    Trails
Six downhill runs and five enduro lines off the Beauregard and the Cret du Merle, inside a wider network of 125 km of marked trails across the Aravis. Steeper and more wooded than the big Tarentaise parks, and small enough to ride everything in a day. The village at the bottom is a genuine mountain town rather than a purpose-built base.

    Getting up / price
The Beauregard gondola from the village at 1040 m, plus the Cret du Merle and Cret du Loup chairlifts. Bike day pass 23.50 EUR adult, 19 EUR child.

    Open season
Open from 13 June; closed from 20 September (published 2026 dates). Weekends in June and September, daily 1 July to 30 August.
Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00
Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.

    Access
From | Transport | Duration
Lausanne | Car | ~1h40
Annecy | Car | ~40 min

    Source: La Clusaz.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</desc>
  </wpt>
