    <name>Linga Longa Bike Park (Western Australia) [shuttle access]</name>
    <desc>Linga Longa 115 m - purpose-built gravity trails near Southampton

    Trails
A dedicated gravity bike park in the southwest region of Western Australia, featuring purpose-built downhill and flow trails. Located near Southampton, roughly 200 km south of Perth in the Margaret River wine region. Trail details and current operations should be verified locally before visiting.

    Getting up / price
Shuttle-based access; no fixed lift infrastructure. Check local trail groups or the Western Australian Mountain Bike Association for current access arrangements, pricing, and operating status.

    Open season
Year-round access typical for Western Australia coastal climate. Confirm current trail status and any seasonal closures locally.
