    <name>Cerro Catedral (Bariloche, AR) [lift pass, price unverified]</name>
    <desc>Amancay 1705 m - top of the Telecabina Amancay

    Trails
Among the largest bike parks in South America, dropping through lenga forest inside the Nahuel Huapi national park with Lago Gutierrez below and the Andes behind. Eight marked descents cover everything from first-timer flow to genuinely technical downhill, and the chairlifts above the gondola reach a little over 2000 m if you want the long way down.

    Getting up / price
The Telecabina Amancay runs year-round from the base at 1055 m and takes bikes in summer; the Lenga and Nubes chairlifts extend the terrain to about 2000 m. Summer operating dates and bike-carriage rates were listed as to be confirmed when this was compiled - check catedralaltapatagonia.com before you count on it.

    Open season
Open from 1 December; closed from 15 April (typical window; check the operator and conditions). Southern-hemisphere season.
Daily opening hours: 09:00-16:30
Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.

