  <wpt lat="46.533100" lon="15.603900">
    <name>Bike Park Pohorje Maribor (SI) [36.50-49 EUR]</name>
    <desc>Pohorska Vzpenjaca, Maribor - World Cup gravity park

    Trails
A proper gondola-served park descending almost into Maribor, with progression from the green 2.4 km Family Line to flow and jump lines, red hand-built enduro trails and the legendary black World Cup course. World Cup drops 431 m over 2 km through roots, rocks, speed and large jumps; Fury adds steep natural corners and drops, while the expanded Areh zone provides more family, flow and technical riding.

    Getting up / price
The Pohorska Vzpenjaca gondola serves the main hill, with additional lifts in the Areh zone. Adult 2026 day passes are 36.50-44 EUR on weekdays depending on period and 49 EUR Friday-Sunday and holidays. Gravity Card is accepted. The lower Family Line can sometimes operate outside the main season when snow-free, but check the live trail and lift status.

    Open season
Open from 11 March; closed from 1 December (published opening and 2026 season-pass end used as the practical season).
Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00
Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.

    Access
From | Transport | Duration
Maribor centre | Bus / bike | ~20 min
Graz | Car | ~55 min

    Source: official 2026 opening notice, official trail descriptions and official 2026 prices.</desc>
