    Trails
A small proper downhill park in Serbia's main mountain resort. Three named descents - KGB, Struga and Mordor - total about 5 km across different surfaces, from approachable sections to steeper technical terrain. A skills area in Dolina Sportova adds practice features, while the wider mountain hosts longer MTB routes and the annual Tri Strane Kopaonika event.

    Getting up / price
The four-seat Pancicev Vrh chairlift has bike carriers and serves the downhill trail starts. Bike rental is available near the lift base. Summer lift dates, daily bike acceptance and prices can vary, so confirm them with the resort before travelling specifically for the park.

    Open season
Open from 15 June; closed from 15 September (typical summer-lift window; exact 2026 bike-park dates not published in the sources checked).
