    Trails
About 30 km of purpose-built riding across nine descents and five difficulty levels. Long blue and red marathon lines drop through pine forest, while black tracks, jumps, a North Shore line and the separate Flow Zone cover more committed riding and skill progression.

    Getting up / price
The village gondola serves the park. The published adult day pass starts at 24.50 EUR, with four-hour and multi-day options also available.

