One-way purpose-built trails spread across the resort, from smoother blue flow and a progressive skill zone to red, black and competition-level downhill. The park hosts major Polish and European DH racing.

    Getting up / price
Gondola and chairlifts provide bike uplift. Current 2026 bike-pass prices are sold through the resort and were not reliably exposed here.

    Open season
Open from 1 May; closed from 1 November (typical lift window; shoulder-season operation may be weekends only).
