    <desc>Gora Zar 761 m - steep gravity trails above Miedzybrodzie Zywieckie

    Trails
A smaller Polish gravity venue with fast shaped sections and technical forest riding on a steep hill. It is best suited to intermediate and expert riders rather than first-time mountain bikers.

    Getting up / price
The PKL funicular carries riders toward the trail starts when bike service is operating. Current bike-specific pricing was not reliably published; confirm carriage and trail status before travelling.

    Open season
Open from 1 May; closed from 1 October (typical 2026 bike season, subject to announcements and weather).
