    <name>Munaka Bike and Hike Park (Estonia) [chairlift price unverified]</name>
    <desc>Vaike Munamagi above Otepaa - Estonia's chairlift-served bike park

    Trails
A small purpose-built enduro park using Estonia's unusually hilly Otepaa terrain. Short descents mix shaped features and natural forest surfaces, with bike rental and e-bike routes extending the riding beyond the lift hill.

    Getting up / price
Estonia's only summer chairlift carries bikes. Current day pricing was not reliably exposed, so check the operator before visiting.

    Open season
Open from 19 June; closed from 22 September (published main season). Weekend operation is standard; riding before and after the main dates is available to prebooked groups through 1 November.
