    <name>Valgehobusemae Bike Trail (Estonia) [no lift]</name>
    <desc>Valgehobusemae Recreation Centre - long forest and bog-country MTB loop

    Trails
A signed cross-country route of up to 50 km circles Valgehobusemae and Kakerdaja bog. Expect forest tracks, rolling singletrack and remote sections rather than gravity-park features; shorter options suit less experienced riders.

    Getting up / price
No lift: the network is ridden as pedal-powered loops. Access information and bike rental are available from the recreation centre.

    Open season
Open from 1 May; closed from 2 October (published cycling season).

    Access
