    <desc>Riekstukalns near Baldone - Latvia's most established downhill training hill

    Trails
Short, steep community-maintained downhill lines use the ski hill's compact vertical, with roots, jumps and race-oriented features. This is a local training venue rather than a full-service destination park.

    Getting up / price
No dependable public bike uplift was verified: expect push-up or pedal access unless an event announces otherwise. Confirm access with the local downhill community.

    Open season
Open from 1 May; closed from 1 November (typical regional riding window; event and land-use restrictions can apply).

