    <desc>Gauja valley slopes at Sigulda - Latvian downhill and enduro terrain

    Trails
Short, steep natural descents around the deeply cut Gauja valley support local downhill training and racing. Expect roots, loam and compact technical runs rather than a signed commercial bike-park network.

    Getting up / price
No dependable public bike uplift was verified. Use pedal or push-up access and confirm the current legal training location with local riders before setting out.

