    <name>Molyne Bike Park (Vilnius, LT) [no lift]</name>
    <desc>Plytines forest in Vilnius - small community skills and trail park

    Trails
A compact community-built area with an easy family trail and a jump line. The vertical is modest, but it is Lithuania's clearest purpose-built MTB progression spot and can be linked with longer forest riding around Antakalnis.

    Getting up / price
No lift: pedal or push back to the starts. No mandatory access price was verified; respect community maintenance and any posted forest rules.

    Open season
Open from 1 April; closed from 1 December (typical riding window). Avoid wet or freeze-thaw conditions that damage the small trail network.
