    <desc>Lac Blanc 1200 to Lac Blanc 900 - the leading gravity park in the Vosges

    Trails
A long-established proper bike park with family and progression tracks, freeride, downhill, North Shore wood features and fast technical expert lines. The natural Vosges forest surface adds roots and rock beneath the shaped berms and jumps.

    Getting up / price
The dedicated lift returns bikes from Lac Blanc 900. The published 2026 adult day pass is 33 EUR; DH bike and protection rental is available at the base.

    Open season
Open from 11 April; closed from 26 October (published 2026 span). Daily or selected weekday operation runs in July and August; spring and autumn are primarily weekends and holidays.
Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00
Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.

    Access
From | Transport | Duration
Colmar | Car | ~40 min
Strasbourg | Car | ~1h20

