  <wpt lat="45.866725" lon="6.408692">
    <name>Manigod - Tete de Cabeau (Aravis, FR) [18 EUR]</name>
    <desc>Tete de Cabeau 1650 m - small family-oriented lift park at Croix Fry

    Trails
Five family descents and one advanced trail make this a compact progression park. The green Aiglon line is about 1.1 km with 84 m of descent; harder variants add more speed, natural surface and technical features without the scale of nearby La Clusaz.

    Getting up / price
The Tete de Cabeau chairlift carries mountain bikes. The published 2026 adult day pass is 18 EUR, with single rides available for 8 EUR.

    Open season
Open from 27 June; closed from 31 August (published 2026 dates), operating 10:00-17:00 subject to conditions.
Daily opening hours: 10:00-17:00
Published operating hours; check the operator schedule.

    Access
From | Transport | Duration
Annecy | Car | ~45 min
Lausanne | Car | ~1h35

    Source: official Manigod 2026 lift page; check trail status.</desc>
  </wpt>
