    Trails
A network of unofficial singletrack, fireroad climbs and DIY technical descents through the forested Western Hills (Xishan / Xiangshan / Miaofengshan) above Haidian District. Trails range from easy fireroads to steep expert lines with rock gardens. This is a local-community riding zone, not a sanctioned or signed trail network.

    Getting up / price
No lift. All riding is pedal-up or shuttle via local group arrangements. No trail pass required. Respect park access rules and avoid hiking paths where cycling is prohibited.

