    <name>Yetopia MTB Park (Yilan, TW) [shuttle, NT$300]</name>
    <desc>Taiwan's only purpose-built mountain bike park

    Trails
Three downhill/enduro trails descend from the ridge above Toucheng: Wild Boar (0.8 km, 226 m drop, easy flow), Muntjac (1.1 km, 202 m drop, medium, rocky/rooty) and Timber Trail (0.8 km, 100 m drop, hard, drops and off-camber). A 20 km XC loop (1,000 m ascent) and a pump track round out the park.

    Getting up / price
No mechanical lift. Shuttle van uplift: NT$500 half-day, NT$800 full-day (unlimited laps). Trail pass: NT$300/day. Full-suspension rental: NT$1,500/day. Summer season pass NT$1,500 (Jul-Nov). Guided sessions available.

    Open season
Open year-round; avoid typhoon months (late July to mid September).

    Access
From | Transport | Duration
Taipei | Train + transfer | ~1h30
Yilan / Jiaoxi | Car / taxi | ~30 min

    Source: official Yetopia.
