  <wpt lat="63.399000" lon="13.075800">
    <name>Are Bike Park (Sweden) [gondola / chairlift]</name>
    <desc>Scandinavia's largest lift-served bike park

    Trails
Around 40 downhill trails descend from exposed rock slabs into forest, including the long Easy Rider flow line, technical Hallrajd and the classic rocky 1000-metersleden. Separate trail and XC areas add substantial pedal riding.

    Getting up / price
VM8 chairlift and gondola serve the downhill network. Bike pass, rental and guiding are available in Are village.

    Open season
Published 2026 downhill season: weekends from 5 June, daily 21 June-30 August, then Thursday-Sunday through 27 September.
Daily opening hours: 10:00-16:00
Published 2026 standard hours; lift and trail status can vary.

    Access
From | Transport | Duration
Ostersund | Train / car | ~1h30

    Sources: Are summer lifts and Are Bike Park guide.</desc>
  </wpt>
