Purpose-built green, blue, red and black downhill lines combine smooth berms and jumps with rougher forest technical terrain. Registration is required before riding, with rental and instruction at the base.

    Getting up / price
Lift-served bike park; purchase a bike pass and complete the rider registration.

    Open season
Published 2026 season: 14 May-1 November, daily 22 May-30 August, then Friday-Sunday plus autumn holidays.
Daily opening hours: 09:30-16:00
Published standard hours; some Fridays and Saturdays extend to 17:00.

