Thirteen bike-park routes and a wider 114 km MTB network range from the Hidden Forest beginner skills area to technical black lines. Northern Flow runs for more than 4 km from the fell.

    Getting up / price
Gondola2000 and Express lifts carry bikes. Rental, protection and instruction are available at Gondolitie.

    Open season
Published 2026 bike-park season: 19 June-20 September.
Daily opening hours: 10:00-18:00
Published 2026 bike-park and rental hours.

