Long natural descents from Postavaru combine roots, loam, rocks and purpose-built bike-park sections, with lines for intermediate through expert riders. Conditions change quickly after rain and trail works.

    Getting up / price
Poiana Brasov gondola access is used for bike uplift when summer operations permit. Confirm bike carriage, current trails and pass price before departure.

    Open season
Typically late May-October, subject to maintenance and weather. 2026 trail preparation was underway in May.
Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00
