    <desc>Ukraine's principal lift-served downhill park

    Trails
One blue, two red and one black downhill trail use jumps, narrow bridges and natural forest obstacles. Lift 2 carries bicycles.

    Getting up / price
2026 advertised adult price: UAH 800/day, UAH 550 half-day or UAH 350 single ride.

&amp;#9888;&amp;#65039; Ukraine remains at war. Missile and drone attacks can occur in western regions; multiple governments advise against non-essential or all travel. Do not treat resort operation as evidence that travel is safe.

