Erciyes developed Turkey's first dedicated downhill courses and has hosted European downhill racing, with multiple difficulty levels and a children's skills area on open volcanic terrain.

    Getting up / price
Resort lifts exist and planning documents describe bike transport, but current 2026 public bicycle uplift, maintained routes and pricing were not verified. Contact Erciyes before travel.

