  <wpt lat="36.303462" lon="-115.679692">
    <name>Lee Canyon Bike Park [lift pass]</name>
    <desc>Lift-served downhill bike park above Las Vegas

    Trails
Lee Canyon is Southern Nevada's lift-served downhill bike park, with green, blue and black trails including machine-built flow and technical natural terrain. Uphill travel is not permitted; riders must stay on designated trails.

    Getting up / price
The chairlift serves all bike-park trails. Day-ticket prices vary by demand. The 2026 Mountain Bike Power Pass includes unlimited access to Lee Canyon, Brian Head and Purgatory for the bike-park season, plus Spider Mountain access.

    Open season
Summer bike-park season, with dates and operating days subject to weather and conditions. Check the live calendar before travelling.

    Access
From | Transport | Duration
Las Vegas | Car | ~45 min

    Sources: Lee Canyon MTB lift tickets, Mountain Bike Power Pass and Lee Canyon mountain biking. Verify current lift operation and trail status.</desc>
  </wpt>
