  <wpt lat="-13.282743" lon="-72.106663">
    <name>El Santisimo Downhill (Urubamba, Peru) [race course, access unverified]</name>
    <desc>Valle Sagrado downhill course at San Isidro de Chicon

    Trails
A 2.4 km race descent dropping 421 m from roughly 3548 m to 3127 m. The surface is fast-draining gravelly and sandy earth with abundant loose and embedded rock. El Santisimo hosts a COPACI- and UCI-sanctioned American Series MTB downhill event.

    Getting up / price
No permanent lift or public day price is published. Race transport and normal public riding access are not equivalent; arrange a local guide or event entry before attempting the course.

    Open season
Open from 1 May; closed from 1 November (conservative dry-season indication). The 2026 race ran 23-26 April, but ordinary access must be confirmed locally.

