    <desc>Forested downhill trails in Georgia's historic mountain resort

    Trails
Bakuriani has designated downhill-only mountain-bike trails on the wooded resort slopes, including the documented N1 line. The lower elevation and forest make it a useful contrast to exposed Gudauri, with natural roots and compact gravity riding around town.

    Getting up / price
The resort has summer lifts, but current bicycle carriage, park tickets and a dependable 2026 operating calendar were not found. Treat the trails as pedal or locally arranged vehicle access until the operator confirms otherwise.

