    Trails
Shahdag advertises specialized downhill cycling paths for multiple ability levels amid the high Greater Caucasus landscape. Resort rental makes it accessible without transporting a bike, though the published product is less developed and less precisely mapped than a conventional European bike park.

    Getting up / price
No bicycle-carrying lift is documented, even though pedestrian lifts operate in summer. Confirm whether access is pedal, vehicle-supported or lift-assisted before buying. Published adult e-bike rental is 25 AZN for 20 minutes, 42 AZN for 40 minutes or 50 AZN for one hour.

