    <name>Wakan Titan of the Hill (Oman) [historic race, no lift]</name>
    <desc>Steep Hajar Mountain enduro race terrain

    Trails
The cliffside village of Wakan hosted the first Red Bull Titan of the Hill downhill and enduro competition in 2017. Rocky mountain paths, tight village terrain and severe exposure made it a striking race venue, but there is no documented permanent signed course or routine bike operation today.

    Getting up / price
No lift or regular shuttle. The village approach requires a capable vehicle and any riding requires current local permission and a guide who can avoid pedestrian steps, orchards and private areas.

&amp;#9888;&amp;#65039; Do not ride the village's walking stairway or assume an old event course remains legal. Exposure, loose rock, extreme heat and flash floods are serious hazards.

