Guided cycling itineraries from Kalaw cross rolling Shan highlands, tea plantations, farms and village paths before descending toward Inle Lake. Sections use dirt roads and genuine singletrack, but this is shared rural adventure riding rather than a maintained gravity park.

    Getting up / price
No lift. Local operators historically offered mountain-bike hire, guides and vehicle support. Confirm that a reputable operator is currently functioning and that the entire itinerary is lawful and safe before booking.

&amp;#9888;&amp;#65039; As of July 2026, official advice warns against all but essential travel to southern and eastern Shan State. Conflict is volatile, restrictions can change without notice and rural landmine risk exists. Do not plan this ride while advice remains in force.

