The Fouta Djallon foothills around Kédougou, Dindefelo and Dandé are Senegal's clearest mountain-bike landscape. Community traces document rides near Étiolo and Dindefelo, while regional tourism sources identify the rough tracks and mountain relief as suitable for VTT. Expect village paths, rock, dust and short natural descents rather than a bike park.

