The Adrar around Chinguetti combines sandstone plateaus, abrupt escarpments, rocky pistes and the Ouarane dunes. Community cycling records include long MTB-capable routes around Chinguetti, but this is remote desert expedition terrain rather than signed singletrack or a gravity park.

