Bagofit Sun City hosts the Chantal Biya mountain-bike race on a rugged 15 km circuit. About 5 km runs through forest, with laterite, tree trunks, water holes and mud forming the principal obstacles. This is an event and cross-country-oriented course with short natural descents, not a permanent lift-served bike park.

