No lift or documented public shuttle. Contact Bagofit Sun City or the race organizer before travelling: access to the complete competition circuit outside an event has not been confirmed.

&amp;#9888;&amp;#65039; Do not assume the race course is marked, maintained or open year-round. Tropical rain can make its water and mud obstacles unsafe.

