Mabira Central Forest Reserve has an established 25 km mountain-bike loop linking rainforest trails with surrounding tea and sugar plantations. It is rolling adventure and cross-country terrain with roots, clay and short natural descents rather than a gravity park.

    Getting up / price
No lift or regular shuttle. Ride from the Najjembe visitor centre; local guided tours can include a mountain bike, helmet, food and water. Older published entry prices are not reliable enough to quote, so confirm fees and bike availability before arrival.

