  <wpt lat="47.074290" lon="9.962480">
    <name>Trailpark Hochjoch - Silvretta Montafon (Vorarlberg, AT) [41.50 EUR]</name>
    <desc>Kapell 1850 m - top of the Hochjoch Bahn

    Trails
Three hand-built flow trails, close to seven kilometres of them, dropping about 500 m from the Kapell restaurant at 1850 m to the mid-station at Gasthaus Kropfen. Hubertus is the long, forgiving one at just over 4 km and the right first lap; Wolfsgruaba and Kilka Wald step up the speed and the technical content without ever turning into a downhill track. No black lines and no bike-park jumps - this is a flow trail park, and a very good one.

    Getting up / price
Bike carriage on the Hochjoch Bahn only, from Schruns. The summer day ticket is 41.50 EUR (two-day 83 EUR); single-ride tickets exist if you only want one lap, and multi-day, season and annual ticket holders add a bike-transport option instead.

    Open season
Open from 15 June; closed from 12 October (typical window; check the operator and conditions).
