  <wpt lat="60.604460" lon="-135.062220">
    <name>Mount Sima Bike Park (Yukon, CA) [40 CAD]</name>
    <desc>Mount Sima 1154 m - top of the bike park chairlift

    Trails
Whitehorse's lift-served park, a short drive from downtown, with two blue flow runs (including a 3.9 km machine-built line), an expert black and two extreme double-black lines - Lefty Loosey and Drop the Clutch among them, with Righty Tighty on the intermediate side. Compact vertical (around 260 m) but a good mid-week evening lap spot.

    Getting up / price
Day ticket 40 CAD adult, 35 CAD youth (U18) and 65+.

    Open season
Open from 22 June; closed from 7 September (typical window; check the operator before travel).
Daily opening hours: 11:00-19:00, extended to 22:00 Wednesdays and Fridays for Bike Nights
Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.

