  <wpt lat="55.055920" lon="-118.860250">
    <name>Nitehawk Bike Park (Alberta, CA) [28 CAD]</name>
    <desc>Nitehawk 673 m - top of the Bauer Triple Chair

    Trails
A gravity park just south of Grande Prairie with green, blue and black lines built around berms, log rides, doubles, skinnies, drops and tabletops. Dirty Deeds (blue, downhill only) is a signature run, with a technical black connector through to O'Brien.

    Getting up / price
Bauer Triple Chair uplift. Adult full day 28 CAD (half day 25 CAD), children 12 and under full day 22 CAD (half day 20 CAD).

    Open season
Open from 20 May; closed from 30 August (typical window; check the operator before travel).
Daily opening hours: Wed 17:30-21:00, Sat 12:00-17:00
Limited weekly schedule; check the operator calendar.

