  <wpt lat="46.295780" lon="14.521570">
    <name>Krvavec Bike Park (Slovenia) [31 EUR]</name>
    <desc>Krvavec 1490 m - top of the Krvavec cable car

    Trails
Six marked trails, roughly 30 km in total, with the largest elevation difference among Slovenian bike parks. Rock'n'Flow is the long signature descent; Muci, Bambino, Panorama and Jezerca give a spread from beginner to advanced. The park is part of the GravityCard network.

    Getting up / price
The Krvavec cable car lifts from the valley to the bike-park base; the bike-park pass also covers the Tiha dolina 4-seater chairlift for mid-mountain laps. Adult day pass 31 EUR, youth (15-18.99) 28 EUR, children (6-14.99) 21 EUR; 3-hour pass 27 EUR; single ride 16 EUR. Season pass 300 EUR adult.

    Open season
Open from 22 July; closed from 1 October (published main season 22 July - 31 August with off-season weekends/holidays through 30 September; hours vary, verify before travel).
Daily opening hours: 09:00-18:00 typical main season; check operator schedule
Cable car and Tiha dolina chairlift operate on a restricted weekday/weekend pattern.

    Access
From | Transport | Duration
Ljubljana | Car | ~35 min
Kranj | Car | ~25 min
Brnik airport | Car | ~15 min

    Sources: RTC Krvavec bike park, prices and schedule, location and Visit Kranj.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</desc>
  </wpt>
