  <wpt lat="42.725880" lon="0.989970">
    <name>Baqueira Beret Bike Park (Val d'Aran, Spain) [30 EUR]</name>
    <desc>TSD Clot der Os 2200 m - top of the main bike-park chairlift

    Trails
Eleven signed BTT routes spread across the resort, mostly dropping from the two bike chairlifts. Noted routes include 87A Clot der Os, 87B Ta Baqueira, 86 Pla de Beret, 80 Camin dera Aigua, 80A Dera Cascada, 80B Tortuga, 80C Bosque, 80D Baqueira and 80E-80F Telesera. The mix covers easy family flow, intermediate singletrack and steeper technical descents; several routes are shared with hikers, so respect on-site signage and daily closures.

    Getting up / price
Two chairlifts carry bikes: the TSD Clot der Os and the TSD Bosque. The day bike pass gives unlimited ascents and descents on both lifts. Adult day pass 30 EUR; child (born 2015-2023) 20 EUR. Multi-day bike passes and a July-August BaqueiraPASS Summer are also sold.

    Open season
Open from 1 July; closed from 6 September (published 2026 dates). TSD Clot der Os runs until 30 August, TSD Bosque until 6 September.
Daily opening hours: 10:00-18:00; last ascent 17:45
Lift access depends on weather; check the live summer trail status before riding.

    Access
From | Transport | Duration
Vielha | Car | ~30 min
Barcelona | Car | ~4 h
Toulouse | Car | ~3 h 30

    Sources: Baqueira Beret summer 2026 announcement, summer lift passes, MTB routes, summer map and access information. Prices, lifts and trails can change; verify before travel.</desc>
  </wpt>
