  <wpt lat="46.203740" lon="7.141920">
    <name>Ovronnaz (Jorasse) [26 CHF / Magic Pass]</name>
    <desc>Jorasse 1940 m - top of the Jorasse chairlift

    Trails
Ovronnaz is a Magic Pass destination above the Rhone valley. From the Jorasse chairlift top, natural singletrack and gravel descend back toward the village and neighbouring valleys - long, remote all-mountain terrain rather than a groomed bike park.

    Getting up / price
Chairlift day pass 26 CHF adult. Magic Pass holders ride free.

    Open season
Open from 20 June; closed from 25 October (published 2026 dates, plus a pre-opening weekend 13-14 June).

    Source: Ovronnaz.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</desc>
  </wpt>
