  <trk>
    <name>Martigny: Tour de la Vallee du Trient</name>
    <desc>40.5 km difficult MTB loop with about 1,705 m of climbing. A demanding full tour from Martigny through Vernayaz, the Trient valley, Les Marecottes, Le Tretien, Finhaut and the Col de la Forclaz before the long return to Martigny. Source: Martigny Tourism. Official GPX geometry supplied by Martigny Tourism, simplified to 15 m.</desc>
