  <trk>
    <name>Pilatus: Pilatustrail</name>
    <desc>2.8 km technical natural trail

Named singletrack in the Pilatus area, with roots, tight turns and variable terrain. This is a natural mountain trail, not a maintained bike-park line.

Geometry simplified from OpenStreetMap way 120875145 (ODbL). Lift and access context: Pilatus Bahnen. Confirm bike carriage and local trail restrictions before riding.</desc>
