  <wpt lat="45.958198" lon="9.126114">
    <name>Monte Tremezzo (Lake Como) [no lift]</name>
    <desc>Monte Tremezzo MTB route

A long natural mountain-bike route on the western shore of Lake Como, linking the high slopes above Menaggio and Porlezza with broad lake and mountain views. This is a pedal-accessed enduro/XC route, not a lift-served bike park.

Source: OpenStreetMap relation 12662560 (ODbL) and Visit Como. Check local access, hiking traffic and trail conditions.</desc>
  </wpt>
  <trk>
    <name>Monte Tremezzo MTB route</name>
    <desc>12.8 km natural MTB route

Long mountain-bike line across the Monte Tremezzo area above Lake Como. It includes forest paths, rough mountain tracks and exposed sections; ride only where cycling is permitted and yield to hikers.

Geometry simplified from OpenStreetMap relation 12662560 (ODbL). Indicative line; confirm the current route and local restrictions before riding.</desc>
