  <wpt lat="45.212429" lon="6.402090">
    <name>Les Karellis Bike Park (Maurienne) [lift access]</name>
    <desc>Les Karellis bike park

A small Maurienne bike park with two official downhill lines: the blue Cool'Kar and red Déval'Kar. The resort is a good compact addition for riders looking for lift-served riding away from the larger Portes du Soleil parks.

Sources: Les Karellis bike park information and Les Karellis resort. Confirm lift operation and trail status before travelling.</desc>
  </wpt>
  <trk>
    <name>Les Karellis: Cool'Kar</name>
    <desc>5.4 km blue downhill line

The official Cool'Kar trail, the easier of the two Les Karellis bike-park descents.

Geometry simplified from OpenStreetMap relation 14384502 (ODbL). Trail classification and resort context: Les Karellis official bike-park page. Follow signs and current conditions.</desc>
